export anchor ArtDecoStyle:
    number: 24
    screen: LandingPage
    name: Art deco
    idea: A gilded 1920s poster, with cream paper, black bands, deep gold sunbursts and stepped fans, and tall condensed capitals set in strict symmetry.
    base: light
    palette:
        cream: #f3ead6, the page
        ivory: #fbf6ea, the hero arch, feature panels, fields and the style sheet
        jet: #15120d, text, the top bar, the quote band, the footer and the primary button
        goldLeaf: #c8a14b, rules, sunburst rays, double frames and the focus halo, never text
        goldInk: #6e5212, gold text on cream such as eyebrows and the accent half of the headline
        goldOnJet: #d9b660, gold text, lines and the primary button label on black
        taupe: #5e5446, body copy, notes and captions
        emerald: #1d5c46, the On track chip with a diamond
        amber: #7a4e00, the At risk chip with a triangle
        oxblood: #8c1c1c, the Overdue chip with a crossed square
    type:
        Two stacks. Display caps use Futura Condensed, Avenir Next
        Condensed, Roboto Condensed, Helvetica Neue Condensed, Arial Narrow,
        sans-serif-condensed with font-stretch condensed, always uppercase
        and tracked 0.12 to 0.28em. Text uses Didot, Bodoni 72, Bodoni MT,
        Big Caslon, Georgia, serif. The headline is 92px bold caps at 0.98
        line height, section titles 44px caps, the quote 44px serif italic,
        feature titles 22px caps, body 17px serif at 1.6, labels and nav
        14px caps.
    layout:
        A black top bar with a fan mark, the spaced caps brand, caps nav
        links and a Start free button, edged by a doubled gold line. The
        hero is centred inside a tall ivory arch with a round top and a
        double gold frame, over gold sunburst rays fanning up from below.
        An eyebrow flanked by short double rules sits above the headline,
        whose second half is gold. Under the arch a black plaque lists three
        projects with due dates and status chips. The logo strip is one
        centred line of caps names split by gold diamonds between double
        rules. Three features are ivory panels with stepped ziggurat tops
        and black roman numeral medallions. The quote is a full black band
        with a gold fan hanging from its top edge. The closing band is a
        double framed ivory box. The footer is black with gold caps
        headings. Below 760px the nav folds into a Menu disclosure and
        panels stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit in big steps of 24, 32, 48 and 96px. Sections have 96px above and below.
    density: Sparse and ceremonial. One idea per band, everything centred on one vertical axis.
    corners: Square. The only curves are the large hero arch and arched swatch tops. Feature panels get stepped corners in 16px steps.
    borders: Double gold hairlines, a 1px line, a 4 to 6px gap, then another line. Black bars carry a doubled gold edge.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from stacked frames and black bands.
    icons:
        Geometric filled shapes in currentColor at text size, such as a
        diamond play mark and a fan logo. Status chips are ivory with a
        filled diamond for On track, a filled triangle for At risk and a
        crossed square for Overdue, always with the caps word.
    focus: A 2px jet outline offset 3px inside a 6px gold halo. On black a 2px gold outline. A focused field gets a gold underline and a cream fill.
    tone: Formal and declarative in spaced capitals, such as What Brightwork does, warmed by italic serif lines.
